# Binary assets — never run newline conversion on these.
# The repo is developed on Windows with core.autocrlf=true; without these
# rules git relies on content heuristics to spot binaries, and a font or a
# .blend mangled by CRLF conversion fails at render time, not at commit time.
*.ttf  binary
*.otf  binary
*.blend binary
*.mp4  binary
*.mp3  binary
